}
```

#### 2. Update `processor.go`

In this file, you'll add the registration logic for the new processor.

```go
// cmd/mdatagen/internal/processor.go
package internal

import (
    "go.opentelemetry.io/collector/component"
)

// Factory for the latency processor
type Factory struct{}

func (f *Factory) Type() component.Type {
    return component.NewType("latency_processor")
}

func (f *Factory) CreateTracesProcessor(ctx context.Context, set processor.Settings, cfg component.Config) (consumer.Traces, error) {
    return NewLatencyProcessor(set.TracesConsumer), nil
}
```

#### 3. Integrate With the Main Application

In your main application where pipelines are configured, ensure you include the `latency_processor` in the pipeline.

Here's an example configuration snippet (this may vary based on your actual setup):

```yaml
