The modifications include creating a new `LatencyProcessor` and integrating it into your existing processing pipeline. Ensure it properly records latencies in accordance with your system's telemetry collection practices. You can add the `RecordProcessingLatency` function to record latency data into your monitoring system if applicable.

Lastly, integrate unit tests to validate the functionality of this new processor. This will ensure that any changes or behaviors surrounding the processor can be reliably tracked.
